@KutuphaneApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5041

### ===== Authors =====

### Tüm yazarlar
GET {{KutuphaneApi_HostAddress}}/api/authors
Accept: application/json

### Tek yazar
GET {{KutuphaneApi_HostAddress}}/api/authors/1

### Olmayan yazar → 404
GET {{KutuphaneApi_HostAddress}}/api/authors/9999

### Yazar ekle → 201
POST {{KutuphaneApi_HostAddress}}/api/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Yaşar",
  "lastName": "Kemal",
  "birthYear": 1923
}

### Geçersiz yazar → 400 + alan hataları
POST {{KutuphaneApi_HostAddress}}/api/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "birthYear": 3000
}

### Yazar güncelle → 204
PUT {{KutuphaneApi_HostAddress}}/api/authors/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ferit Orhan",
  "lastName": "Pamuk",
  "birthYear": 1952
}

### Kitabı olan yazarı sil → 409
DELETE {{KutuphaneApi_HostAddress}}/api/authors/1

###
